<title>USA: Lubbock, Texas, yields 5.25 pct in 2009.</title>
<headline>Lubbock, Texas, yields 5.25 pct in 2009.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co said it priced $17.555 million of Lubbock, Texas, general obligation refunding bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.25 percent in 2009.</p>
